Error [E0204]: `pair` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> reactive_root_capture_replaces_existing_owner_projections.jet:11:27
    |
 11 |         #Reactive { &pair.right.push(4) }
    |                           ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&pair`) only once, or copy first with `~pair`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
